@dialect harness-seq/1
@seq 1
@entry FINISH
🏁 FINISH
Obj(Result ∘ Diff_or_N_A ∘ Checks ∘ Unknowns) → ArtifactSet
ArtifactSet → 🧾 TaskMarkdownSet{knowledge.md,diary.md,walkthrough.md} ∘ TaskReport ∘ EvaluationJSON
⊢ valid(TaskReport) ∧ valid(EvaluationJSON) → 🔎 git.review
⊢ mandatory(mem.etl) ∧ executable($env:LLM_MEMORY_BIN) ∧ valid(ArtifactSet)
⇒ foreach generated task Markdown once: outside_sandbox(llm-mem.ingest(file,category)) → FileIngestReceipt
all_file_receipts_success ⇒ IngestReceipt=SUCCESS(receipt_manifest_id)
any_file_receipt_failed ⇒ IngestReceipt=FAILED(process_error)
⊢ executable($env:LLM_MEMORY_BIN) ∧ valid(EvaluationJSON)
⇒ outside_sandbox(llm-mem.eval(EvaluationJSON)) → EvaluationReceipt=SUCCESS(receipt_id)
missing_executable ⇒ IngestReceipt=FAILED(missing_executable) ∧ EvaluationReceipt=FAILED(missing_executable)
blocked_by_higher_priority_policy ⇒ IngestReceipt=FAILED(process_error) ∧ EvaluationReceipt=FAILED(process_error)
ERROR(llm-mem.ingest) ⇒ IngestReceipt=FAILED(process_error)
ERROR(llm-mem.eval) ⇒ EvaluationReceipt=FAILED(process_error)
MemoryReceipt := IngestReceipt ∘ EvaluationReceipt
⊢ approval(EXT_WRITE,current_task) ⇒ external_diary_mirror(memo/<task_id>/diary.md) → ExternalDiaryMirrorReceipt
¬approval(EXT_WRITE,current_task) ⇒ ExternalDiaryMirrorReceipt=N_A(not_requested)
ERROR(external_diary_mirror) ⇒ ExternalDiaryMirrorReceipt=FAILED(process_error)
⊢ final(IngestReceipt) ∧ final(EvaluationReceipt) ∧ final(ExternalDiaryMirrorReceipt)
⇒ 🧾 write-task-record(memo/<task_id>/{knowledge.md,diary.md,walkthrough.md,evaluation.json}, IngestReceipt, EvaluationReceipt, ExternalDiaryMirrorReceipt)
→ TaskRecordReceipt
🧾 POST_TEST_CHOICE: "ここで終わりにする。/実行してテストログを監視しデバッグフェーズに入る/git pushし、他のマシンでテストしてもらう" → Wait(Answer)
Answer == 終わり ⇒ 🧾 RESULT.share(TaskReport ∘ MemoryReceipt) → 🧑 Human → End(Conversation) ⊣ ⊤
Answer == デバッグ ⇒ DEBUG ↺ (within bounded correction-cycles)
Answer == push ⇒ ⊢ explicit approval(VCS_WRITE,current_task) → 📦 git.commit ∧ git.push (no automatic external message) → VCSReceipt ⇒ 🧾 RESULT.share(TaskReport ∘ VCSReceipt ∘ MemoryReceipt) → 🧑 Human → End(Conversation) ⊣ ⊤
